ref=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Planeslayer_Flail\" title=\"Planeslayer Flail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Planeslayer_Flail\" title=\"Planeslayer Flail\">Planeslayer Flail</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715073936\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1006/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9510/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1845/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1029739/52428800 b